# family_share 配置 / configuration
# 复制为 .env 后修改：cp .env.example .env    Copy to .env and edit.
# 服务器和 `npm run family -- …` 命令启动时都会读取 .env。 Both the server and the CLI read .env on start.
#
# 注意：可选项不用时请保持注释（#），不要留成空值 —— 例如 `STT_BASE_URL=` 会因为不是合法 URL 而启动失败。
# Note: leave optional settings commented out rather than empty — e.g. `STT_BASE_URL=` fails URL validation.

# ─── 服务器 / Server ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 监听端口。Port the server listens on (Vite's dev proxy forwards /api here).
PORT=8787
# 监听地址。用 Tailscale / 反向代理时保持 127.0.0.1；要让局域网直接访问可改成 0.0.0.0。
# Listen address. Keep 127.0.0.1 behind Tailscale Funnel / a reverse proxy; 0.0.0.0 exposes it on the LAN.
HOST=127.0.0.1
# 手机访问用的公开地址（不要带结尾的 /）。邀请链接、通知链接都用它；https 时 cookie 自动加 Secure。
# 推送通知、麦克风和“添加到主屏幕”在手机上都需要 https。地址一旦给家人用了就不要再换：
# 推送订阅、主屏幕 App、登录状态都绑定在这个地址上。
# Public origin the phones use (no trailing slash): invite links and notification URLs are built from it,
# and cookies get Secure when it is https. Phones need https for push, the mic and installing the app.
# Don't change it once the family uses it: push subscriptions, installs and sessions are tied to the origin.
# Dev: http://localhost:5173 (Vite). Real phones: e.g. https://family.example.com
PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:5173
# 数据目录：SQLite 数据库 family.db 和语音文件 audio/ 都在这里（请备份，见下面「备份」）。
# Data directory: holds the SQLite database (family.db) and voice uploads (audio/). Back it up (see Backup below).
DATA_DIR=./data
# 第一次启动时的家庭名称（之后用 `npm run family -- init --name …` 修改）。
# Family name used on first start (change later with `npm run family -- init --name …`).
FAMILY_NAME=我们家
# 家庭时区（IANA 名称），所有“明天早上”“周六 08:30”都按这个时区理解。只在第一次启动时写入数据库；
# 以后用 `npm run family -- init --timezone …` 修改。不填则用这台电脑的系统时区。
# Family IANA timezone: every local time ("明天早上", "周六 08:30") is read in it. Stored in the DB on first run;
# change it later with `npm run family -- init --timezone …`. Defaults to this machine's timezone.
FAMILY_TIMEZONE=Australia/Sydney

# ─── AI（Claude）───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic API key。不填时 AI 关闭：说话/打字不会自动整理成事项，但看板上的按钮照常可用。
# Anthropic API key. Without it the AI is off: utterances end with an explanation, manual buttons still work.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# 模型。Model id (default claude-opus-5-5).
# AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# 思考力度：low | medium | high | xhigh | max（默认 medium）。Effort level (default medium).
# AI_EFFORT=medium
# 服务器端拒答回退（beta），默认开启；设为 0/false/off 关闭。
# Server-side refusal fallbacks (beta). On by default; set 0/false/off to disable.
# AI_FALLBACKS=true
# 每句话最多调用模型几次（1–20，默认 6）。Max model calls per utterance (1–20, default 6).
# AI_MAX_ITERATIONS=6

# ─── 语音识别 / Speech-to-text ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 不配置时 App 隐藏麦克风按钮，用手机键盘自带的语音输入即可。
# Without it the app hides the mic button; the phone keyboard's dictation still works.

# 主识别服务：whisper（本机运行的开源 Whisper，免费、不需要 key）| openai（gpt-transcribe）
# | qwen（阿里云百炼国际站 qwen3-asr-flash）| none。不填时：有 STT_API_KEY 或 OPENAI_API_KEY 就用 openai，否则关闭。
# Primary provider: whisper (open-source Whisper on this machine, free, no key) | openai (gpt-transcribe)
# | qwen (Alibaba Model Studio intl, qwen3-asr-flash) | none.
# Default: openai when STT_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY is set, otherwise off.
# STT_PROVIDER=whisper
#
# whisper：需要一个装了 openai-whisper 的 Python（pip install openai-whisper）和 ffmpeg。模型常驻内存（turbo 约 2–3 GB），
# 空闲 WHISPER_IDLE_MINUTES 分钟后释放。第一次用先运行 npm run family -- stt-test（会下载模型并测速）。
# whisper: needs a Python with openai-whisper (pip install openai-whisper) and ffmpeg. The model stays loaded
# (turbo ≈ 2–3 GB RAM) and is unloaded after WHISPER_IDLE_MINUTES idle. Run `npm run family -- stt-test` once
# first (downloads the model if needed and shows the speed). STT_MODEL picks the model (default turbo).
# WHISPER_PYTHON=/Users/you/.pyenv/versions/whisper_env/bin/python
# cpu（默认，Apple Silicon 上 mps 会报错）| cuda。Device: cpu (default; mps crashes on Apple Silicon) | cuda.
# WHISPER_DEVICE=cpu
# WHISPER_IDLE_MINUTES=15
# 主识别服务的 API key（qwen 填 DashScope / Model Studio 的 key）。
# API key for the primary provider (for qwen: the DashScope / Model Studio key).
# STT_API_KEY=
# OpenAI key；没有 STT_API_KEY 时用它作为主识别服务的 key。
# OpenAI key; used as the primary provider's key when STT_API_KEY is not set.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# 模型（默认 whisper: turbo，openai: gpt-transcribe，qwen: qwen3-asr-flash）。
# Model (default turbo / gpt-transcribe / qwen3-asr-flash).
# STT_MODEL=gpt-transcribe
# 接口地址（可选）。openai 默认 https://api.openai.com；qwen 默认
# https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1（新加坡区也可以用
# https://<WorkspaceId>.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1）。
# Base URL (optional). openai default https://api.openai.com; qwen default
# https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1 (or your Singapore workspace URL).
# STT_BASE_URL=https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1

# 备用识别服务：主服务失败时再试一次（openai | qwen | whisper）。PROVIDER 和 API_KEY 都填才生效（whisper 不需要 key）。
# Fallback provider tried when the primary fails (openai | qwen | whisper). Needs PROVIDER and API_KEY (whisper: no key).
# STT_FALLBACK_PROVIDER=qwen
# STT_FALLBACK_API_KEY=sk-...
# STT_FALLBACK_MODEL=qwen3-asr-flash
# STT_FALLBACK_BASE_URL=https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1

# ffmpeg 路径。录音会先转成 16 kHz 单声道 WAV（iPhone 的 MP4 录音更稳定）；qwen 和 whisper 必须有 ffmpeg。
# 没有 ffmpeg 时 openai 直接收原始录音。macOS: brew install ffmpeg
# Path to ffmpeg. Uploads are normalized to 16 kHz mono WAV (more reliable for iPhone MP4); qwen and whisper need it.
# Without ffmpeg, openai gets the original recording.
# FFMPEG_PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin/ffmpeg

# ─── 网页推送 / Web push (VAPID) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 生成一对密钥：npm run family -- vapid   （更换密钥后所有手机都要重新开启通知）
# Generate a key pair with: npm run family -- vapid   (changing keys invalidates every subscription)
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# 推送服务联系方式，请用真实的 mailto: 或 https: 地址（默认 mailto:admin@example.com）。
# Contact for the push services; use a real mailto: or https: URL (default mailto:admin@example.com).
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com

# ─── 微信 / WeChat（公众号接口测试号 sandbox test account）────────────────────────────
# 在 https://mp.weixin.qq.com/debug/cgi-bin/sandbox?t=sandbox/login 申请测试号，详见 docs/research/wechat.md。
# APPID、APPSECRET、TEMPLATE_ID 都填了才启用微信提醒；不填时设置页会说明如何开通。
# Get a test account at the URL above (see docs/research/wechat.md). WeChat reminders are enabled only when
# APPID, APPSECRET and TEMPLATE_ID are all set.
# 测试号的 appID / appsecret。Test account appID / appsecret.
# WECHAT_APPID=wx...
# WECHAT_APPSECRET=
# 你在“接口配置信息”里填的 Token，用来校验回调签名；回调地址填 ${PUBLIC_URL}/wechat/mp。
# 不填则只发不收（不能用“绑定 123456”绑定，也不能在微信里发文字给助手）。
# The Token you entered under 接口配置信息 (verifies callback signatures); the callback URL is ${PUBLIC_URL}/wechat/mp.
# Without it WeChat is outbound only (no "绑定 123456" binding, no texting the assistant).
# WECHAT_TOKEN=
# 测试模板 ID。模板内容：事项：{{task.DATA}} 来自：{{from.DATA}} 时间：{{when.DATA}} 备注：{{note.DATA}}
# Test template id. Template body: {{task.DATA}} {{from.DATA}} {{when.DATA}} {{note.DATA}}
# WECHAT_TEMPLATE_ID=
# 测试号二维码图片地址（可选），显示在设置页方便家人关注。
# Optional image URL of the test account's follow QR code, shown in settings.
# WECHAT_FOLLOW_QR_URL=https://example.com/wechat-qr.png

# ─── 提醒调度 / Scheduler ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 调度器多久检查一次到期提醒（毫秒，默认 30000）。有新提醒入队时会立即检查。
# How often the scheduler looks for due notifications (ms, default 30000); it also runs right after an enqueue.
# SCHEDULER_INTERVAL_MS=30000
# 请求发出后多久还没回复就提醒对方（分钟，默认 120；有截止时间时会更早）。
# Minutes until the asked person gets a follow-up when they haven't answered a request (default 120; sooner when due soon).
# REQUEST_FOLLOWUP_MIN=120
# 请求发出后多久还没回复就告诉发起人（分钟，默认 360）。
# Minutes until the asker is told there is no reply yet (default 360).
# REQUEST_NOREPLY_MIN=360

# ─── 备份 / Backup ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 这几项只有 scripts/backup.sh 读取（scripts/install-backup.sh 装的每晚 03:30 任务，见 README「备份」）。
# 每次运行都会重新读取，改了不用重启服务器，也不用重装任务。
# Read only by scripts/backup.sh (the nightly 03:30 job from scripts/install-backup.sh, see the README), on every
# run: no server restart or reinstall needed.

# 备份放在哪里（默认 ~/Backups/family_share）。放在另一块硬盘上才能防硬盘损坏。
# Where backups go (default ~/Backups/family_share). Use another disk to survive a disk failure.
# BACKUP_DIR=~/Backups/family_share
# 保留最近几天的备份（默认 14）。Days of backups to keep (default 14).
# BACKUP_KEEP_DAYS=14
# 录音保留几天：每晚备份后删除更早的录音，文字记录保留。不填则一直保留所有录音。
# Days to keep voice recordings: older ones are deleted after the nightly backup (transcripts stay). Unset: keep all.
# AUDIO_KEEP_DAYS=30
